    "explanation": "The $6.00 no-show fee stands as charged, and the driver is paid the platform's standard 80% compensation of $4.80. I address both parties.\n\nFOR THE DRIVER: All four limbs of POL-NS-01 hold on full-weight telemetry. (a) the trip record carries your 'arrived' event at 21:20:05 (EV-TRIP-00401); (b) the GPS trace places you inside the 150 m AIRPORT arrival radius before that event — first qualifying in-geofence fix at 21:20:00, 50 qualifying fixes, closest approach 21.3 m to the pin (EV-GPS-00401); (c) the dwell, measured as limb (c) directs from the first qualifying in-geofence fix and not from the tap, runs 490 seconds (21:20:00 to the 21:28:10 cancellation) against the 480-second free waiting period in force from trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec — a 10-second surplus, and no_show_threshold_sec is not set; (d) you terminated at 21:28:10 under RIDER_NO_SHOW with no boarding event, at or after the dwell elapsed. POL-NS-05 does not apply: at the arrival marker you were stationary inside the radius, neither 300 m out nor moving at 15 km/h. POL-NS-03 does not apply: your stationary fixes lie inside the radius, not outside it within 400 m. POL-NS-06 is not engaged: the derived shortfall is minus 10 seconds, so there is no premature-cancellation refund. Your two messages (21:20:25 naming 'T1 arrival bay 3', 21:23:05) and your unanswered 25-second call (21:24:05) are in EV-CHAT-00401 and trip_record.in_app_calls. POL-NS-07 fixes your payout at 80% of the SGD 6.00 fee = SGD 4.80, and the anti-farming check does not trip: no_show_terminations_30d is 1 (below 4) and 1/120 completed trips = 0.008 (below 0.08), so both limbs fail and compensation is paid rather than withheld.\n\nFOR THE RIDER: I accept the long flight and the delayed bag as real, but under POL-GEN-01 your length of custom (account_age_days 700, lifetime_trips 240, rating 4.78) and the baggage delay are context only and cannot ground a decision; they are not reasons the charge falls. POL-NS-04 cannot exonerate you: you sent no locating or coordinating message at all (limb (a) fails), and in any event the driver placed an in-app call before terminating (limb (b) fails); and on limb (c) your own device is against you — all 54 rider fixes sit about 1,202 to 1,211 m from the pin at zero speed, with 0 qualifying fixes inside the 200 m AIRPORT presence radius, so the account of searching the pickup area is not what your device records. The rider advocate's narrower point is correct and I accept it: your silence is not one of POL-NS-01's conditions, and it does not have to be — every limb of that clause is a condition on the driver's conduct, and all of them are met on the driver's evidence. On the rider advocate's other points: POL-NS-12 is indeed unavailable because the arrival marker is a driver-pressed BUTTON and not GPS_AUTO, so the charge must rest on the exported trace — and it does, on full-weight (1.0) complete telemetry; the absence of platform wait-timer corroboration therefore changes nothing. The traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00401-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT, POL-GEN-02(3) disclosure), but it assists neither side: it only removes the option under POL-NS-06(i) to sum separate in-geofence intervals, which the driver does not need because his 490-second dwell is one unbroken run.\n\nESCALATION AND EXECUTION: No POL-NS-09 trigger fires — the trace is complete (105 fixes, 10-second cadence, max gap 0.0), the chat log's 4 messages match chat_message_count with no sequence gap, no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, disputes_with_counterparty_90d is 0 on both profiles, the anti-farming check is clear, and no deciding artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08(a)-(d) (the fare line of SGD 6.00 reconciles with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd, and clock skew is 5 seconds, far inside 90). The monetary effect is the SGD 4.80 driver compensation, which does not exceed the SGD 8.00 execution threshold under POL-GEN-05, so it executes on issue."
